				"objectNames": [
					"Uncle Luo"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711050801,
					"content": "Ah, it's you, Traveler. You seem in a terrible hurry. Did some trouble come up?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050802,
					"content": "We... Well, do you know where Xiangjun and her grandfather live, Uncle Luo? We're looking for them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050803,
					"content": "Xiangjun? Never heard of her. Is she from around here? I'm sure I know everyone in the village...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050804,
					"content": "Really? That can't be... We met a little girl outside who called herself Xiangjun, and said she lives in Qiaoying Village. She asked us to help her find her grandfather...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050805,
					"content": "She also has a big bamboo raft!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050806,
					"content": "Well, you can find those quite easily, but Xiangjun... I'm fairly sure there's no one by that name in our village. What does her grandfather go by?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050807,
					"content": "He's an herb gatherer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050808
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711050808,
					"content": "A herb gatherer? Let me think. We did have one, so I recall... But it's been three years since he passed...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050809,
					"content": "He passed away!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050810
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050810,
					"content": "Aye. He encountered monsters in the wild and... *sigh* Still, I doubt that's who you're looking for.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050811,
					"content": "He was always a little off his rocker, and he never got married, never mind having descendants of any sort.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050812,
					"content": "Wait... What's going on here? So, that Xiangjun we met...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050813,
					"content": "...Could she have been the real demon!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050814,
					"content": "What sorts of herbs did your herb gatherer, well, gather?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050815
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711050815,
					"content": "Flowers and grasses, none of which we've ever seen. 'Fraid I only know this and that about tea, so I'd be little help here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050816
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050816,
					"content": "But I do remember that we found him near Mt. Xuanlian. He was still clutching a bottle of water.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050817,
					"content": "He said that he had a divine plant in his yard that needed that sort of blessed water to grow. Load of hogwash if you ask me — I mean, it's all just river water. Nothing special about it! Why'd he have to give up his life on account of something like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050818
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050818,
					"content": "*sigh* Still, after we buried him, we poured the water he obtained out in that yard of his. I hope that brought him some solace.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050819
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050819,
					"content": "The blessed waters of Mt. Xuanlian? We went there and drew some water, too... So, this herb gatherer of yours...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050820
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050820,
					"content": "I think we're talking about the same person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050821
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 711050821,
					"content": "Well, that's strange happenings, and no mistake... Why don't you come with me? I'll take you to that fellow's yard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711050822
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711050822,
					"content": "If you did draw water, I suppose you can just pour it out in his yard.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7110511,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7110511
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7110511",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7110511,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Uncle Luo"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 711051101,
					"content": "If there's nothing else, I'll leave you to look around as much as you'd like.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711051102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711051102,
					"content": "So there really wasn't anyone named Xiangjun...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711051103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 711051103,
					"content": "I'll ask around. Maybe it was just a little mistake somewhere. Y'know, like someone forgetting where they live, and such.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						711051104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				},
				{
					"id": 711051104,
					"content": "In any case, thanks for helping that \"adeptus\" water the herbs. I'm sure he'll do what he can to defend you from harm as thanks.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Uncle Luo"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}